cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Black-mass bioleaching refinery — process design and mass balance
message: If you use this work, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shah
    given-names: Keshav
repository-code: "https://github.com/keshavsshah/bioleach-pfd"
abstract: >-
  Conceptual process design for a 10,000 t/yr spent lithium-ion black-mass
  refinery using a Gluconobacter oxydans gluconic-acid biolixiviant. Includes a
  six-sheet process flow diagram, a closed mass balance for all seven blocks,
  PHREEQC speciation, and a cited design basis.
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-13"
